# Test ASCII variants

# Numbers

Okuphumayo bhala: (2 !=: 3), umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: (2 <=: 2), umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: (2 >=: 2), umugqa-omusha.

# Strings

Okuphumayo bhala: (['b'] >=: ['a']), umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: (['b'] !=: ['a']), umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: (['b'] <=: ['c']), umugqa-omusha.

# Bools

Okuphumayo bhala: (Iqiniso !=: Amanga), umugqa-omusha.

# Objects

Okuphumayo bhala: (Into okusha !=: Into okusha), umugqa-omusha.

# ASCII list symbol <-:

Okuphumayo bhala: (Uhlu <<: 1, ; 2 ; 3) inani = 3, umugqa-omusha.

